BEGIN OF PROCEDURE DIVISION BANK_OFFICE MAIN DICTIONARY IF FINAL.

FIXTURES: Test Data for Verification and Validation; FIXTURE-1, FIXTURE-2, FIXTURE-3, FIXTURE-4
END OF PROGRAM

WORKING-STORAGE SECTION:
    IDENTIFICATION-VAR -1024 TO 99999 : Balance (in cents) -- FIXED TYPE FOR ACCURACY AND PRECISION
    IF IS INITIAL BALANCE < 5 AND COUNT > 0 THEN          -- Check if any items exist and balance is low to alert user
        PERFORM ALERT-MANDATORY-INITIAL-SUFFICIENT-BALANCE
    ENDIF

END OF PROCEDURE DIVISION. BANK_OFFICE MAIN DICTIONARY IF FINAL.

FIXTURES: Test Data for Verification and Validation; FIXTURE-1, FIXTURE-2, FIXTURE-3, FIXTURE-4
